{"full":"hf:suhailma/cropdrop-env","spaceId":"suhailma/cropdrop-env","name":" CropOps Agent","source":"huggingface","description":"An interactive AI application on Hugging Face Spaces.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":null,"topics":["docker","region:us"],"technologies":[],"likes":4,"created":"2026-04-01T05:59:49.000Z","updated":"2026-04-26T10:57:40.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://suhailma-cropdrop-env.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/suhailma/cropdrop-env","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T15:56:59.807Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T15:56:59.807Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T15:56:59.807Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🌾","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["OpenEnv Hackathon India 2026 · Round 2 · Theme 3: World Modeling","CropOps Agent is an OpenEnv-compatible reinforcement learning environment where an agent navigates a 10×10 grid, picks up crops from villages, and delivers them to the correct warehouse zones before they spoil — under partial observability and stochastic disruptions (road blocks, rain, vehicle breakdowns).","The environment exposes a FastAPI server (/reset, /step, /state, /tasks, /grader/{task}, /render, /health) and is deployed as a HuggingFace Space."],"features":["Real 10×10 spatial grid — agent physically navigates tile by tile","6 explicit actions: up, down, left, right, pickup, dropoff","3 live disruption types per episode","Curriculum training: 1 crop → 2 crops → 3 crops","LLM fine-tuning with HuggingFace TRL SFT on Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct"],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/suhailma/cropdrop-env/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9fc8cf47dbb8a0b219f9c489b1354bf0f6d914b4b1805a470cccd9cb934950c4","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T15:32:38.845Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T15:56:59.899Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"OpenEnv Hackathon India 2026 · Round 2 · Theme 3: World Modeling","sourceUrl":"https://hu